{"id":"262f4d908228c75f","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction.md","title":"组合子括号抽象","display":"df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction — 组合子括号抽象","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction","aliases":["72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction"],"display":"df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction — 组合子括号抽象","depends_on":["[[72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra]]"],"chapter":"VI","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VI §2.2 lambda-abstraction clauses, print423/PDF435","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"source recursion and finite construction checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction — 组合子括号抽象"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a722d09fe9b7b184\" href=\"?note=a722d09fe9b7b184\" title=\"72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra\">72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VI"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VI §2.2 lambda-abstraction clauses, print423/PDF435"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source recursion and finite construction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a722d09fe9b7b184\" href=\"?note=a722d09fe9b7b184\" title=\"72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra\">72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra</a> 的 PCA 及应用项语法；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in\\omega\">\\(i,j\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in X\">\\(a\\in X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in\\mathcal T_X\">\\(t,u\\in\\mathcal T_X\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ab}_i\">\\(\\mathsf{ab}_i\\)</span> 是下式的语法变换，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fv}_X\">\\(\\operatorname{fv}_X\\)</span> 为自由变量指标集。应用向左结合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{fv}_X(v_j)&amp;:=\\{j\\},\\quad\\operatorname{fv}_X(c_a):=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{fv}_X(tu):=\\operatorname{fv}_X(t)\\cup\\operatorname{fv}_X(u),\\\\\n\\mathsf{ab}_i(v_j)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}c_sc_kc_k,&amp;j=i,\\\\c_kv_j,&amp;j\\ne i,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathsf{ab}_i(c_a)&amp;:=c_kc_a,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{ab}_i(tu):=c_s\\mathsf{ab}_i(t)\\mathsf{ab}_i(u).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{fv}_X(v_j)&amp;:=\\{j\\},\\quad\\operatorname{fv}_X(c_a):=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{fv}_X(tu):=\\operatorname{fv}_X(t)\\cup\\operatorname{fv}_X(u),\\\\\n\\mathsf{ab}_i(v_j)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}c_sc_kc_k,&amp;j=i,\\\\c_kv_j,&amp;j\\ne i,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathsf{ab}_i(c_a)&amp;:=c_kc_a,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{ab}_i(tu):=c_s\\mathsf{ab}_i(t)\\mathsf{ab}_i(u).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>采用原书第一个抽象配方：只有常元和不同变量分支直接用 K，应用始终递归分解。不能将规则擅改为“凡不含 i 的任意 t 都取 Kt”而仍沿用总有值性质；这种修改会要求先求值一个可能无值的 t。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a722d09fe9b7b184","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a722d09fe9b7b184","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra]] 的 PCA 及应用项语法；$i,j\\in\\omega$，$a\\in X$，$t,u\\in\\mathcal T_X$。$\\mathsf{ab}_i$ 是下式的语法变换，$\\operatorname{fv}_X$ 为自由变量指标集。应用向左结合。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"i,j\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"t,u\\in\\mathcal T_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{ab}_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fv}_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{fv}_X(v_j)&:=\\{j\\},\\quad\\operatorname{fv}_X(c_a):=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{fv}_X(tu):=\\operatorname{fv}_X(t)\\cup\\operatorname{fv}_X(u),\\\\\n\\mathsf{ab}_i(v_j)&:=\\begin{cases}c_sc_kc_k,&j=i,\\\\c_kv_j,&j\\ne i,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathsf{ab}_i(c_a)&:=c_kc_a,\\qquad\n\\mathsf{ab}_i(tu):=c_s\\mathsf{ab}_i(t)\\mathsf{ab}_i(u).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1717,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-153","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增15项：[[72-df-applicative-term-evaluation]] · [[72-df-baire-neighborhood-function]] · [[72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-recursive-operations]] · [[72-df-modified-realizability-full-mode